###

### Create Journal
POST {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Describe your happiest memory this week.",
  "mood": {
    "moodType": "HAPPY",
    "value": 9,
    "note": "Scored well in demo session.",
    "location": {
      "latitude": 18.5204,
      "longitude": 73.8567,
      "name": "Pune, India"
    }
  },
  "title": "Demo Day Success",
  "description": "Delivered a perfect pitch in front of the investors.",
  "attachment": {
    "fileName": "demo_pitch.jpg",
    "fileType": "image/jpeg",
    "fileUrl": "https://example.com/files/demo_pitch.jpg"
  }
}

###

### Get Journal By ID
GET {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}/{{journal_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

###

### Get All Journals (Paginated, latest first)
GET {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}?limit=5
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

###

### Get All Journals With Cursor
GET {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}?cursor=2025-05-29T07:15:09.223703&limit=5
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

###

### Update Journal
PUT {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}/{{journal_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Updated prompt",
  "mood": {
    "id": 1,
    "moodType": "HAPPY",
    "value": 8,
    "note": "Feeling great after meditation",
    "timeStamp": "2025-05-29T10:30:00",
    "location": {
      "latitude": 18.5204,
      "longitude": 73.8567,
      "place": "Pune"
    }
  },
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "description": "Updated description text",
  "attachment": {
    "fileName": "meditation.jpg",
    "fileType": "image/jpeg",
    "fileUrl": "https://example.com/images/meditation.jpg"
  }
}

###

### Delete Journal
DELETE {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}/{{journal_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}

###

### Delete Multiple Journals
DELETE {{base_url}}/{{user_id}}
Authorization: {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

